  // belongs to. "E" = official book, "M" = unofficial book, chosen by the dual-book flags — see
  // seriesForAccount() in lib/dispatchInvoicing/core.js.
  //
  // ** invoice_no is NOT unique on its own, and not unique per series either. **
  // Each series restarts at 1 every 1 JULY, so a number is identified by
  // series + fiscal year + number. E-1 exists once for every financial year.
  // Anything looking an invoice up by number must also constrain `dated` to
